# paper-repo — NeurIPS 2026 manuscript

Build (TeX Live 2026): `latexmk -pdf paper.tex` from the assembled delivery root
(figures/ and tables/ come from figtab-repo, code/results from experiment-repo per `assignment.json` in story-repo).

- `paper.tex`, `macros.tex`, `sections/`, `appendix/`, `references.bib`, `checklist.tex`, `neurips_2026.sty`
  (style and checklist from the official NeurIPS 2026 formatting kit, media.neurips.cc).
- `paper.pdf` — compiled manuscript (draft).
- `notes/` — working notes (theory draft, toy pilot), not part of the paper's evidence.
